### Criar bloco (caso válido)
POST http://localhost:8080/bloco
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Bloco A",
  "condominioId": "13a9f78f-19ef-4804-b090-311242b1463c"
}

### Criar bloco com espaços no nome (deve normalizar para "Bloco B")
POST http://localhost:8080/bloco
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "  Bloco B  ",
  "condominioId": "13a9f78f-19ef-4804-b090-311242b1463c"
}

### Nome vazio (deve retornar 400)
POST http://localhost:8080/bloco
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "   ",
  "condominioId": "13a9f78f-19ef-4804-b090-311242b1463c"
}

### Nome com mais de 100 caracteres (deve retornar 400)
POST http://localhost:8080/bloco
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "AAAAAAAAAABBBBBBBBBBCCCCCCCCCCDDDDDDDDDDEEEEEEEEEEFFFFFFFFFFGGGGGGGGGGHHHHHHHHHHIIIIIIIIIIJJJJJJJJJJ",
  "condominioId": "13a9f78f-19ef-4804-b090-311242b1463c"
}

### condominioId ausente (deve retornar 400)
POST http://localhost:8080/bloco
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Bloco C"
}

### Condomínio inexistente (deve retornar 404 com o GlobalExceptionHandler; sem ele, 500)
POST http://localhost:8080/bloco
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Bloco D",
  "condominioId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"
}

### Listar todos os blocos
GET http://localhost:8080/bloco

### Buscar bloco por ID (troque pelo id retornado no POST válido)
GET http://localhost:8080/bloco/COLE-AQUI-UM-UUID-DO-BLOCO